      <activity id="2b4c5e51-69b9-52e8-9d07-3680a11a4afd" activityNameId="7d0e17c2-d5bd-50ec-b2ef-de8c4011c189" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Production plant crude oil, onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Production plant crude oil, onshore
Construction and dismantling of an onshore production field with 100 wells. Life time 20 years.;
dfb70048-c550-3ab0-aa5e-ca8b9eda637b
Materials for construction, energy use for construction. Land use and transformation. Disposal of materials after use. Wells are not included and are considered separately. Manufacturing of facilities partly not included.
Location:  Data for fields in RU, US and multinational companies.
Technology: Onshore crude oil production in the Northern hemisphere.
Time period: Data for materials and land use based on information from 1990. Data for energy and material uses during construction from 2007. New assumption for life time.
Production volume: Unknown.
Sampling: Publication in environmental reports and other literature.
Extrapolations: Applied on all onshore operations. Data vary considerably depending on infrastructure necessary to access the place. No data for Middle East.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dfb70048-c550-3ab0-aa5e-ca8b9eda637b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
